1369:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****      * `to_mont_rep()` on them), yielding a result that's also * R mod N (aka
1370:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****      * "in the Montgomery domain"). Here we only multiply one operand by R mod
