1384:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c **** /*
1385:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * Exponent blinding supposed to prevent side-channel attacks using multiple
1386:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * traces of measurements to recover the RSA key. The more collisions are there,
1387:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * the more bits of the key can be recovered. See [3].
1388:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  *
1389:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * Collecting n collisions with m bit long blinding value requires 2^(m-m/n)
1390:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * observations on average.
1391:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  *
1392:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * For example with 28 byte blinding to achieve 2 collisions the adversary has
1393:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * to make 2^112 observations on average.
1394:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  *
1395:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * (With the currently (as of 2017 April) known best algorithms breaking 2048
1396:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * bit RSA requires approximately as much time as trying out 2^112 random keys.
1397:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * Thus in this sense with 28 byte blinding the security is not reduced by
1398:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * side-channel attacks like the one in [3])
1399:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  *
1400:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * This countermeasure does not help if the key recovery is possible with a
1401:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  * single trace.
1402:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c ****  */
1403:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c **** #define RSA_EXPONENT_BLINDING 28
1404:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/rsa.c **** 
