 351:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  *                   representing the bignum to conditionally add
 352:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  *                   to \p X. This may be aliased to \p X but may not
 353:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  *                   overlap otherwise.
 354:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  * \param limbs      Number of limbs of \p X and \p A.
 355:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  * \param cond       Condition bit dictating whether addition should
