 358:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  * \warning          If \p cond is neither 0 nor 1, the result of this function
 359:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  *                   is unspecified, and the resulting value in \p X might be
 360:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  *                   neither its original value nor \p X + \p A.
