 362:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  * \return           1 if `X + cond * A >= 2^(biL*limbs)`, 0 otherwise.
 363:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  */
