 649:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  *
 650:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  * \return          1 if `A < b`.
 651:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.h ****  *                  0 if `A >= b`.
